Prepare a bounded, source-versioned evidence slice for confirmScope. Present drawings or structured specifications, finish samples, assumptions, and acceptance criteria for customer confirmation. Bind the quote to the accepted revision, then create production work only after material scope and commercial terms are approved. Include direct observations, current authority, contrary evidence, a plausible rival interpretation, and missing decisive fields. Carry forward the actual prior-stage records when provided.
